Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.28,0:00:23.32,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}[One Piece\NEpisode 1173]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.88,0:05:57.20,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}[Desa Barat]
